      hu: ["Wazir Khan alapította az 1630-as években.", "Az evőeszközök és sebészeti eszközök világméretű központja.", "A Chenab-folyó feletti Alexandra-hidat 1876-ban adták át.", "Kiemelkedő szerepet játszik a minőségi basmati rizs termesztésében.", "Stratégiai helyen fekszik a történelmi Grand Trunk Road mentén.", "Számos fémipari és technológiai oktatási központ otthona."],
      ro: ["Fondat în anii 1630 de către Wazir Khan.", "Centru mondial pentru fabricarea tacâmurilor și instrumentelor chirurgicale.", "Podul Alexandra peste râul Chenab a fost inaugurat în 1876.", "Locație importantă pentru cultivarea orezului basmati.", "Situat strategic pe drumul istoric Grand Trunk Road.", "Găzduiește institute de formare specializate în metalurgie."],
      en: ["Founded in the 1630s by Wazir Khan during the Mughal era.", "Global hub for the manufacture of cutlery and surgical instruments.", "The Alexandra Bridge over the Chenab River opened in 1876.", "Major location for the cultivation of premium Basmati rice.", "Strategically located on the historic Grand Trunk Road.", "Home to specialized training institutes for metallurgy and crafts."],
